    "detailed_description": "A physics puzzle game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Rules Description-.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen you put sushi on top of sushi, <br />\r\nthe sushi you make will flow down the lane.<br />\r\nFeed the customers and keep them full!<br />\r\nWhen they are full, the next customer will come.<br />\r\nThe game is over when the sushi is out of the box!<br />\r\nAim for a high score!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Evolution List&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKappamaki<br />\r\n\u2193<br />\r\nEgg<br />\r\n\u2193<br />\r\nTekkamaki<br />\r\n\u2193<br />\r\nhorse mackerel<br />\r\n\u2193<br />\r\noctopus<br />\r\n\u2193<br />\r\neel<br />\r\n\u2193<br />\r\nSalmon<br />\r\n\u2193<br />\r\nsalmon<br />\r\n\u2193<br />\r\nShrimp<br />\r\n\u2193<br />\r\nSea bream.<br />\r\n\u2193<br />\r\nsea urchin<br />\r\n\u2193<br />\r\nOotoro (Big fatty tuna)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAim for! Consistently Ootoro !<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;How to Operate&quot;<br />\r\nUse the mouse when the sushi cursor appears.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbKeybord<br />\r\nA/D       Move<br />\r\nQ/E       Rotation<br />\r\nSpace   Make a drop in sushi<br />\r\nEsc       Option<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbMouse (auxiliary to keyboard)\t<br />\r\nScroll    Rotation<br />\r\nLeft      Make a drop in sushi",
